## 📊 Success Metrics

After implementing this strategy, you should see:

- ✅ **100% location retrieval success rate** (either fresh or cached)
- ✅ **No app freezes** due to location timeouts
- ✅ **Graceful degradation** when GPS is unavailable
- ✅ **Fast app startup** (location loads in background)
- ✅ **Battery efficient** (10m distance filter)

---

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The key to this strategy's success is **never relying on a single method**. Always have a fallback, always have a timeout, always handle errors gracefully.
